---
import ResponsiveImage from './ResponsiveImage.astro';
import { Facebook, Instagram, Phone, ArrowUpRight } from 'lucide-react';
import { business, navigation } from '../config';
---
<footer class="footer"><div class="container"><div class="footer-top"><div><a href="/" class="brand" data-scroll-home aria-label="SeviElectro, inicio"><ResponsiveImage src="/media/original/Logo-SeviElectro-1.png" width="500" height="123" sizes="(max-width:640px) 162px, 204px" loading="lazy" alt="SeviElectro · Instalaciones eléctricas y electrónicas"/></a><p>Tu solución a todo lo eléctrico.</p></div><nav aria-label="Navegación del pie">{navigation.slice(1).map(([label,id])=><a href={`/#${id}`}>{label}</a>)}</nav><div class="footer-social"><a href={business.facebook} aria-label="Facebook"><Facebook size={17}/></a><a href={business.instagram} aria-label="Instagram"><Instagram size={17}/></a><a href={business.whatsapp} aria-label="WhatsApp"><Phone size={17}/></a></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} SeviElectro · Quito, Ecuador</span><div><a href="/aviso-legal/">Aviso legal</a><a href="/privacidad/">Privacidad</a><a href="/cookies/">Cookies</a></div><a href="/#inicio">Volver arriba ↑</a></div><p class="footer-credit">Web creada por <a href="https://sergiotech.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">sergiotech.es <ArrowUpRight size={12}/></a></p></div></footer>
